WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:01.108
mothers inside Russia where they

00:00:01.241 --> 00:00:03.543
could be jailed for what they're

00:00:03.677 --> 00:00:04.945
saying for speaking out is

00:00:05.078 --> 00:00:05.345
significant.

00:00:05.479 --> 00:00:06.446
The pressure inside Russia comes

00:00:06.446 --> 00:00:08.815
as we're getting new video of

00:00:08.949 --> 00:00:10.450
Ukraine taking out a devastating

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.452
weapon that Putin has been using

00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:15.155
to inflict mass casualties on

00:00:15.289 --> 00:00:15.622
the front lines.

00:00:15.756 --> 00:00:18.458
You've heard about the

00:00:18.458 --> 00:00:20.861
thermobaric weapons.

00:00:20.994 --> 00:00:22.729
This is the multiple rocket

00:00:22.863 --> 00:00:23.497
launcher system.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:24.698
And we've talked about them from

00:00:24.831 --> 00:00:27.200
the beginning of the war because

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:27.701
they're horrific.

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:30.837
They're banned under the Geneva

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:32.105
convention for a reason because

00:00:32.472 --> 00:00:38.679
they suck the oxygen out of

00:00:38.812 --> 00:00:40.080
people's lungs.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.482
And Russia's been using it in

00:00:42.482 --> 00:00:42.549
Ukraine.

00:00:42.683 --> 00:00:44.117
Ukraine take that one out.

00:00:44.484 --> 00:00:45.819
And Putin's forces are suffering

00:00:45.953 --> 00:00:48.021
major losses on the battlefield.

00:00:48.155 --> 00:00:49.022
However, he is still fighting

00:00:49.156 --> 00:00:51.024
and he is celebrating a big win

00:00:51.158 --> 00:00:51.358
tonight.

00:00:51.491 --> 00:00:53.026
Tonight the government of

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.029
Switzerland announcing it will

00:00:56.163 --> 00:00:58.498
not confiscate Russian assets,

00:00:58.498 --> 00:00:59.166
saying it's unconstitutional to

00:00:59.299 --> 00:00:59.900
do this.

00:01:00.033 --> 00:01:04.571
Russian oligarchs do stash

00:01:04.705 --> 00:01:07.307
massive amounts of money in

00:01:07.441 --> 00:01:09.242
Switzerland, up to $40 billion.

00:01:09.376 --> 00:01:11.311
This isn't the money of everyday

00:01:11.445 --> 00:01:11.678
Russians.

00:01:11.812 --> 00:01:12.579
Switzerland is where oligarchs

00:01:12.713 --> 00:01:14.514
and Putin's inner circle have

00:01:14.614 --> 00:01:15.148
long played.

00:01:15.282 --> 00:01:17.417
It's the reported home of

00:01:17.551 --> 00:01:19.386
Putin's ex-wife.

00:01:19.519 --> 00:01:20.821
We've highlighted it at the base

00:01:20.954 --> 00:01:22.522
of a mountain in Davos where of

00:01:22.556 --> 00:01:24.091
course the powerful and rich

00:01:24.524 --> 00:01:25.525
just recently met.

00:01:25.659 --> 00:01:26.560
And according to the "Wall

00:01:26.693 --> 00:01:27.861
Street journal," Putin's

00:01:27.995 --> 00:01:30.931
girlfriend, the Russian olympic

00:01:31.064 --> 00:01:33.467
gymnast has resided in a

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.802
high-walled mansion near Geneva.

00:01:35.936 --> 00:01:36.937
Switzerland now still says it's

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:38.071
committed to supporting Ukraine.

00:01:38.205 --> 00:01:40.807
But the reality is, is that

00:01:40.941 --> 00:01:42.542
money is what is fueling Putin's

00:01:42.676 --> 00:01:46.546
major offensive.

00:01:46.546 --> 00:01:49.549
It is what will fuel an

00:01:49.683 --> 00:01:51.151
offensive that may very well --

00:01:51.284 --> 00:01:52.552
I'm sorry, include a new front

00:01:52.686 --> 00:01:53.653
from Belarus.

00:01:53.787 --> 00:01:55.555
The "Financial times" reporting

00:01:55.689 --> 00:01:56.823
that western intelligence shows

00:01:56.957 --> 00:01:58.091
Russian aircraft gathering at

00:01:58.225 --> 00:01:59.993
the Belarusian border with

00:02:00.127 --> 00:02:01.695
Ukraine, signaling what could be

00:02:01.828 --> 00:02:04.564
a major -- and they say -- an

00:02:04.631 --> 00:02:06.099
imminent air offensive.

00:02:06.233 --> 00:02:06.933
Fred pleitgen is "Outfront."

00:02:07.067 --> 00:02:09.469
He is in Minsk, Belarus,

00:02:09.603 --> 00:02:09.803
tonight.

00:02:09.936 --> 00:02:11.338
You had rare access to the

00:02:11.471 --> 00:02:12.873
border between Belarus and

00:02:13.006 --> 00:02:13.607
Ukraine today.

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:14.841
This is the border that all eyes

00:02:14.975 --> 00:02:16.576
around the world are on to see

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:17.944
what Putin is really gathering,

00:02:18.078 --> 00:02:19.312
what's happening there.

00:02:19.446 --> 00:02:19.780
You were there.

00:02:19.913 --> 00:02:22.783
What did you see?

00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:24.184
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Yeah, and so much

00:02:24.584 --> 00:02:25.585
concern on the Ukrainian side

00:02:25.719 --> 00:02:26.853
about that border.

00:02:26.987 --> 00:02:28.588
I was just on the Ukrainian side

00:02:28.588 --> 00:02:30.190
of that border a couple of weeks

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:31.590
ago.

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:32.592
And the Ukrainians really are

00:02:32.592 --> 00:02:36.596
worried that Putin could use

00:02:36.696 --> 00:02:41.501
Belarus once again for a launch

00:02:41.635 --> 00:02:41.768
pad.

00:02:41.902 --> 00:02:43.403
The access that we got today was

00:02:43.537 --> 00:02:45.906
part of a Belarusian government

00:02:46.039 --> 00:02:47.441
organized trip, with all the

00:02:47.574 --> 00:02:49.142
restrictions of that entailed.

00:02:49.276 --> 00:02:51.278
But we certainly get some pretty

00:02:51.411 --> 00:02:51.912
interesting insights.

00:02:52.045 --> 00:02:57.684
Here's what we saw.

00:02:57.818 --> 00:03:00.220
As Russian forces ramp up their

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.923
assault at eastern Ukraine, Kyiv

00:03:03.056 --> 00:03:04.991
believes the Kremlin's massive

00:03:05.125 --> 00:03:07.427
spring offensive may already be

00:03:07.561 --> 00:03:08.228
well underway.

00:03:08.628 --> 00:03:10.030
And Russian president Vladimir

00:03:10.163 --> 00:03:11.731
Putin could again use Belarus as

00:03:11.965 --> 00:03:15.902
a launching pad for attacks.

00:03:16.036 --> 00:03:17.971
On a visit organized by the

00:03:18.105 --> 00:03:20.140
Belarusian government, we saw

00:03:20.273 --> 00:03:21.508
the Ukrainians aren't taking any

00:03:21.641 --> 00:03:21.842
chances.

00:03:21.975 --> 00:03:23.210
The Belarusians say from their

00:03:23.343 --> 00:03:24.644
side, this border crossing is

00:03:24.778 --> 00:03:26.313
open, but you can see over there

00:03:26.646 --> 00:03:28.215
that's Ukrainian territory, and

00:03:28.648 --> 00:03:30.884
over there that crossing is

00:03:31.017 --> 00:03:31.451
definitely shut.

00:03:31.585 --> 00:03:33.253
There are several layers of

00:03:33.386 --> 00:03:34.788
barbed wire and Earth mounts to

00:03:34.921 --> 00:03:36.323
make sure no one can get

00:03:36.656 --> 00:03:36.790
through.

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:38.325
Russia launched its main thrust

00:03:38.658 --> 00:03:39.392
towards Kyiv through Belarus

00:03:39.526 --> 00:03:41.294
almost a year ago, penetrating

00:03:41.428 --> 00:03:44.664
all the way to the Gates of

00:03:44.698 --> 00:03:45.599
Ukraine's capital before its

00:03:45.732 --> 00:03:50.203
forces were decimated and

00:03:50.337 --> 00:03:50.670
retreated.

00:03:50.704 --> 00:03:52.706
Today, the situation of the

00:03:52.839 --> 00:03:55.842
belarusian/ukrainian border

00:03:55.976 --> 00:03:57.344
remains tense.

00:03:57.477 --> 00:03:59.279
Although this crossing is

00:03:59.412 --> 00:04:01.648
usually calm, even here some

00:04:01.781 --> 00:04:02.015
trolling.

00:04:02.149 --> 00:04:08.221
The Ukrainians fly the white,

00:04:08.355 --> 00:04:10.190
red white flag, one of the many

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:11.358
provocations the Belarusians say

00:04:11.491 --> 00:04:15.262
and they've beefed up their own

00:04:15.395 --> 00:04:16.963
forces here.

00:04:17.097 --> 00:04:17.998
&gt;&gt; Translator: Mainly border

00:04:18.131 --> 00:04:20.233
guard units have been expanded.

00:04:20.367 --> 00:04:21.234
Before it was two people.

00:04:21.368 --> 00:04:22.702
Now it's three or five.

00:04:22.702 --> 00:04:24.704
The armament and equipment were

00:04:24.704 --> 00:04:27.541
also updated.

00:04:27.674 --> 00:04:28.775
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Belarus says all

00:04:28.909 --> 00:04:30.343
the measures they're taking here

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:31.444
are purely defensive.

00:04:31.578 --> 00:04:33.747
But Minsk recently conducted

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:34.714
large-scale air force drills

00:04:34.814 --> 00:04:36.716
with the Russian military, and

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.852
the U.S. Believes Russia is

00:04:38.985 --> 00:04:41.755
amassing aircraft near Ukraine's

00:04:41.888 --> 00:04:42.389
border.

00:04:42.722 --> 00:04:44.758
Putin recently hinting he's even

00:04:44.891 --> 00:04:48.962
considering placing nukes into

00:04:49.095 --> 00:04:50.263
Belarus.

00:04:50.397 --> 00:04:51.198
&gt;&gt; Translator: I consider it

00:04:51.331 --> 00:04:52.866
possible to continue the

00:04:52.999 --> 00:04:54.267
implementation of the president

00:04:54.401 --> 00:04:55.902
of Belarus' proposals on

00:04:56.036 --> 00:04:57.671
training the crews of combat

00:04:57.804 --> 00:04:59.472
aircraft of the army of Belarus,

00:04:59.606 --> 00:05:00.740
which have been converted for

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:03.043
the possible use of air-launched

00:05:03.176 --> 00:05:04.744
ammunition with a special war

00:05:04.744 --> 00:05:04.945
head.

00:05:05.078 --> 00:05:06.746
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Belarusian

00:05:06.813 --> 00:05:07.581
president Alexander lukashenko

00:05:07.714 --> 00:05:11.785
acknowledging he needs Putin.

00:05:11.918 --> 00:05:12.852
&gt;&gt; Translator: Let's be honest.

00:05:12.986 --> 00:05:14.754
Are we capable alone without

00:05:14.821 --> 00:05:16.756
Russia to defend our sovereignty

00:05:16.823 --> 00:05:18.258
and Independence?

00:05:18.391 --> 00:05:21.027
We are not.

00:05:21.161 --> 00:05:23.129
&gt;&gt; Reporter: In the towns near

00:05:23.263 --> 00:05:24.197
the belarusian/ukrainian border,

00:05:24.331 --> 00:05:28.001
the war next door weighs

00:05:28.134 --> 00:05:28.401
heavily.

00:05:28.768 --> 00:05:29.803
&gt;&gt; Translator: It makes me cry,

00:05:29.936 --> 00:05:30.203
of course.

00:05:30.337 --> 00:05:30.804
It is scary.

00:05:30.937 --> 00:05:32.439
You are afraid for the people

00:05:32.772 --> 00:05:32.872
there.

00:05:32.872 --> 00:05:33.807
And of course you want to

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:34.841
influence the situation somehow.

00:05:34.975 --> 00:05:37.344
But I am an ordinary person.

00:05:37.477 --> 00:05:39.045
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Others fully in

00:05:39.179 --> 00:05:40.180
Putin's corner.

00:05:40.313 --> 00:05:41.815
I ask this man if he thinks

00:05:41.948 --> 00:05:45.118
Belarus should support Russia.

00:05:45.252 --> 00:05:46.019
&gt;&gt; Translator: We are one nation

00:05:46.152 --> 00:05:47.454
with Russia.

00:05:47.587 --> 00:05:49.623
We absolutely should help them.

00:05:49.756 --> 00:05:51.358
&gt;&gt; Reporter: For now, all is

00:05:51.491 --> 00:05:53.593
quiet at the

00:05:53.727 --> 00:05:54.794
belarusian/ukrainian border.

00:05:54.961 --> 00:05:57.330
A nervous calm folks here hope

00:05:57.464 --> 00:06:00.000
will hold somehow.

00:06:00.133 --> 00:06:01.468
For the moment, both the

00:06:01.601 --> 00:06:02.402
Ukrainians and the U.S. Believe

00:06:02.802 --> 00:06:03.603
that the Russians don't have

00:06:03.737 --> 00:06:05.639
enough ground forces here in

00:06:05.772 --> 00:06:07.040
Belarus right now to launch a

00:06:07.173 --> 00:06:07.841
ground offensive.

00:06:07.974 --> 00:06:10.043
But they also say that missile

00:06:10.176 --> 00:06:12.345
attacks, for instance, and drone

00:06:12.479 --> 00:06:13.446
attacks are very much being

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:14.814
launched from Belarusian

00:06:14.814 --> 00:06:15.448
territory towards Ukraine.

00:06:15.582 --> 00:06:16.816
Now the next big event that

00:06:16.816 --> 00:06:17.984
we're going to be looking at is

00:06:18.118 --> 00:06:19.886
Friday when Belarusian president

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:20.820
Alexander lukashenko is going to

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:23.223
be in Russia speaking with

00:06:23.356 --> 00:06:23.857
Vladimir Putin there.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:25.392
And we'll see then how things

00:06:25.525 --> 00:06:27.060
move forward and whether or not

00:06:27.193 --> 00:06:28.928
Belarus will be drawn even

00:06:29.062 --> 00:06:30.830
deeper into this war.

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:30.964
Erin?

00:06:30.964 --> 00:06:33.300
&gt;&gt; All right, Fred pleitgen,

00:06:33.433 --> 00:06:34.301
thank you very much for your

00:06:34.434 --> 00:06:35.735
crucial reporting there, and on

00:06:35.869 --> 00:06:37.504
the border and of course tonight

00:06:37.637 --> 00:06:39.306
from Minsk.

00:06:39.439 --> 00:06:46.513
Retired air force colonel

00:06:46.846 --> 00:06:46.880
Leighton.

00:06:47.013 --> 00:06:47.480
And also professor of

00:06:47.614 --> 00:06:50.517
international affairs.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:51.685
Colonel, let me start with you.

00:06:51.818 --> 00:06:52.852
Fred just showing us what's

00:06:52.919 --> 00:06:53.920
happening in Belarus.

00:06:54.054 --> 00:06:55.322
As he's very clear to say, you

00:06:55.455 --> 00:06:56.856
don't just go to Belarus and

00:06:56.956 --> 00:06:58.858
film what you want to film.

00:06:58.858 --> 00:07:00.193
This was a government-allowed

00:07:00.327 --> 00:07:00.493
tour.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.462
But nonetheless, he had eyes on

00:07:02.862 --> 00:07:03.296
the ground where really no one

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:06.032
from the west has eyes on the

00:07:06.166 --> 00:07:06.366
ground.

00:07:06.499 --> 00:07:08.501
So how concerned should Ukraine

00:07:08.868 --> 00:07:09.569
be about what's happening in

00:07:09.703 --> 00:07:11.938
Belarus and about this amassing

00:07:12.072 --> 00:07:14.207
is the word that's being used of

00:07:14.341 --> 00:07:16.409
Russian air force in Belarus?

00:07:16.543 --> 00:07:17.677
&gt;&gt; I think they should be very

00:07:17.811 --> 00:07:18.044
concerned.

00:07:18.178 --> 00:07:20.413
And the reason for that is is

00:07:20.547 --> 00:07:22.449
that Belarus was a launching pad

00:07:22.882 --> 00:07:24.951
for the initial invasion last

00:07:25.085 --> 00:07:26.219
year.

00:07:26.353 --> 00:07:27.987
When you look at that, you see

00:07:28.121 --> 00:07:30.323
that this is not going to be a

00:07:30.457 --> 00:07:32.392
ground movement, it looks like,

00:07:32.525 --> 00:07:34.961
because there are no really

00:07:35.095 --> 00:07:35.628
Russian formations that are

00:07:35.762 --> 00:07:37.097
showing up there on the ground,

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:38.898
Russian infantry formations or

00:07:38.898 --> 00:07:39.399
anything like that.

00:07:39.532 --> 00:07:40.533
But there are air formations

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:41.401
that are showing up.

00:07:41.534 --> 00:07:46.239
And the way that Putin and

00:07:46.373 --> 00:07:47.574
lukashenko have spoken about

00:07:47.707 --> 00:07:49.476
this, it's very clear that they

00:07:49.609 --> 00:07:52.979
intend to use Belarusian air

00:07:53.113 --> 00:07:56.916
space to launch missiles against

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:57.484
the Ukrainians.

00:07:57.617 --> 00:07:59.018
&gt;&gt; We hear obviously the Russian

00:07:59.152 --> 00:08:00.420
state media reporter talking

00:08:00.553 --> 00:08:01.454
about ammunition shortages,

00:08:01.588 --> 00:08:02.922
there are issues on the ground.

00:08:02.922 --> 00:08:04.924
And we're well aware of those.

00:08:04.924 --> 00:08:06.559
But at home, those Russian

00:08:06.926 --> 00:08:08.395
mothers that we saw, we've heard

00:08:08.528 --> 00:08:09.329
complaints, but they were very

00:08:09.462 --> 00:08:10.530
clear gathering in a group and

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:11.898
very critical of how their

00:08:12.031 --> 00:08:12.966
children are being treated.

00:08:13.099 --> 00:08:14.100
Here's a little bit more of what

00:08:14.234 --> 00:08:14.934
they said.

00:08:15.034 --> 00:08:16.336
They did use Putin's name

00:08:16.469 --> 00:08:16.936
directly.

00:08:16.936 --> 00:08:18.938
Here's what else they said to

00:08:18.938 --> 00:08:19.139
him.

00:08:19.272 --> 00:08:20.340
&gt;&gt; Translator: Some of the men

00:08:20.473 --> 00:08:21.841
on the front lines are suffering

00:08:21.975 --> 00:08:23.676
from fever and wounds.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:25.578
They have neither been seen by

00:08:25.712 --> 00:08:27.213
doctors nor referred to health

00:08:27.347 --> 00:08:28.281
specialists when requested to

00:08:28.415 --> 00:08:31.184
resolve their ongoing health

00:08:31.317 --> 00:08:31.584
conditions.

00:08:31.718 --> 00:08:32.318
&gt;&gt; They're going through the

00:08:32.452 --> 00:08:33.553
detail saying that their son's

00:08:33.686 --> 00:08:35.321
only had two days on a shooting

00:08:35.455 --> 00:08:36.956
range to even go there and no

00:08:36.956 --> 00:08:37.724
medical supplies, they can't

00:08:37.857 --> 00:08:38.958
come home.

00:08:39.092 --> 00:08:40.560
Do their words at this point

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:41.461
signal anything to you?

00:08:41.594 --> 00:08:42.262
&gt;&gt; Oh, absolutely.

00:08:42.395 --> 00:08:45.598
And the fact that it is shown on

00:08:45.732 --> 00:08:46.966
state TV, the fact that it is

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.968
being reported by Russian

00:08:49.068 --> 00:08:50.970
correspondents, the war

00:08:51.004 --> 00:08:52.038
correspondents, it's very

00:08:52.172 --> 00:08:52.972
important because what the

00:08:52.972 --> 00:08:54.207
government is now doing, what

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:56.376
Putin is now doing is to say,

00:08:56.509 --> 00:08:57.844
look, we've never been in this

00:08:57.977 --> 00:09:00.146
position, we haven't done war

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:01.915
since 1945 since World War II,

00:09:02.048 --> 00:09:03.216
and we understand it's

00:09:03.349 --> 00:09:03.583
difficult.

00:09:03.716 --> 00:09:04.984
We are trying to change it,

00:09:05.118 --> 00:09:06.219
we're trying to make it better.

00:09:06.352 --> 00:09:07.587
But they are not hiding it, and

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:08.988
it's very important because

00:09:08.988 --> 00:09:10.423
that's how Putin thinks he's

00:09:10.557 --> 00:09:12.559
going to get ahead of the game,

00:09:12.992 --> 00:09:16.496
admitting mistakes, saying, yes,

00:09:16.629 --> 00:09:17.197
it is all horrible, but it is

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:17.931
for the good of the nation and

00:09:18.064 --> 00:09:20.200
we are trying to fix it.

00:09:20.333 --> 00:09:23.002
Very loudly and quite often he

00:09:23.002 --> 00:09:24.103
meets with his officials and he

00:09:24.237 --> 00:09:25.872
says, well, now my order is you

00:09:26.005 --> 00:09:27.340
take care of all the problems.

00:09:27.474 --> 00:09:29.776
The problems need to be solved,

00:09:29.909 --> 00:09:31.110
in all the regions they need to

00:09:31.244 --> 00:09:32.212
be solved.

00:09:32.345 --> 00:09:33.980
The governors of the regions go

00:09:34.113 --> 00:09:35.014
to the front lines and talk to

00:09:35.014 --> 00:09:35.648
the soldiers.

00:09:35.782 --> 00:09:38.485
So they try to stay ahead of it

00:09:38.618 --> 00:09:40.086
in order to say this is our

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:41.654
problem for the whole country,

00:09:41.788 --> 00:09:43.857
and we are going to be

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:44.257
victorious.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:45.492
&gt;&gt; And then of course the

00:09:45.625 --> 00:09:46.626
complaints still come at some

00:09:47.026 --> 00:09:47.527
point there's only so much you

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:48.294
can say.

00:09:48.428 --> 00:09:50.663
Oh, I'll help you solve it when

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:51.264
it doesn't resolve.

00:09:51.397 --> 00:09:52.365
I guess that's the big question

00:09:52.499 --> 00:09:54.300
in the context, colonel, of what

00:09:54.434 --> 00:09:55.602
that state media correspondent

00:09:55.735 --> 00:09:57.036
posted today, which is, oh,

00:09:57.136 --> 00:09:59.038
don't worry, we're going to win

00:09:59.038 --> 00:10:00.406
bakhmut, but the Wagner group

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:02.509
doesn't have enough artillery --

00:10:02.642 --> 00:10:03.576
I'm sorry, ammunition.

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:05.211
And by the way, they also have

00:10:05.345 --> 00:10:07.814
issues with artillery and tanks

00:10:07.947 --> 00:10:09.048
and other things but

00:10:09.048 --> 00:10:09.849
specifically ammunition.

00:10:09.983 --> 00:10:11.985
&gt;&gt; That's really their Achilles

00:10:12.118 --> 00:10:13.152
hill, if you will.

00:10:13.286 --> 00:10:14.087
And when you see that problem,

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:17.557
the very fact that they can't

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:19.359
supply even -- even though it's

00:10:19.492 --> 00:10:21.094
private, private in quotation

00:10:21.227 --> 00:10:22.395
marks, Wagner group, that is

00:10:22.529 --> 00:10:23.229
really going to be a real

00:10:23.363 --> 00:10:25.431
problem for them.

00:10:25.565 --> 00:10:27.667
There's only so much papering

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:28.434
over that you can do.

00:10:28.568 --> 00:10:29.903
What Nina was saying is that

00:10:30.036 --> 00:10:31.437
this is the perfect way to try

00:10:31.571 --> 00:10:34.274
to obfuscate what's going on.

00:10:34.407 --> 00:10:35.441
Except if you don't have the

00:10:35.575 --> 00:10:36.376
resources no matter what you

